{"version":1,"key":"card:458","content":{"id":458,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"del","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 关键字的作用是从命名空间中删除一个变量名或从容器对象中删除一个元素。它可以用于删除变量、列表中的元素、字典中的键值对等。"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除变量"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = 10\n>>> del x\n\n>>> x\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nNameError: name 'x' is not defined","language":"py","uuid":"c7aa8289-9e22-4cde-a3c4-d4e5803f6d3b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除对象引用"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> x = [1, 2, 3]\n>>> y = x\n>>> del x\n>>> x\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nNameError: name 'x' is not defined\n\n>>> y\n[1, 2, 3]","language":"py","uuid":"c073cb34-7359-4091-af0c-f0bbd7375494","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"del","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 仅删除对象引用，对象本身是否删除、什么时候删除由 Python 解释器的垃圾回收机制决定"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除列表中的元素"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> my_list = [1, 2, 3, 4, 5]\n>>> del my_list[0]\n>>> my_list\n[2, 3, 4, 5]","language":"py","uuid":"eb8ce108-450f-450b-97a2-f02ef34f4a85","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"删除字典的键值对"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> my_dict = {'a': 1, 'b': 2, 'c': 3}\n>>> del my_dict['a']\n>>> my_dict\n{'b': 2, 'c': 3}","language":"py","uuid":"95f7f63c-d5b2-4dc0-8c4e-e4414f7af009","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果指定的键不存在，会引发 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"KeyError","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 错误"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":">>> del my_dict['d']\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\nKeyError: 'd'","language":"py","uuid":"a385634f-4d9e-4a69-96dc-d92983f3c381","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}],"tags":["Python/del"],"createTime":1719191417884,"updateTime":1743303640441,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640441}}